&Q000467 = An adab (?) to Nuska for Išme-Dagan (Išme-Dagan Q)
@composite
#project: etcslatf/inter
#atf: use unicode
#atf: use math
#etcsl: text-id=c.2.5.4.17
#key: after http://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/cgi-bin/etcsl.cgi?text=c.2.5.4.17&display=Crit&charenc=gcirc#

@div segment A

@div sa-gida A

$ (unknown no. of lines missing)
A.A.1. [...] X KI X [...]
#lem: X; X; X; X; X
#tr.en: The @wDN{Anuna}, the great gods, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.1

A.A.2. {d}a-nun-na diŋir gal-gal-e-ne# [...]
#lem: Anunak[1]DN; diŋir[deity]; gal[big]; X
#tr.en: …… the holy palace, the dwelling-place. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.2

A.A.3. e₂#-gal kug ki-tuš IM X GID₂ mu-X [...] X
#lem: egal[palace]; kug[purify]; kituš[dwelling place]; X; X; X; X; X; X
#tr.en: Lord @wDN{Nunamnir} has appointed you as his chief minister; he has firmly put the holy sceptre in your hand, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.3

A.A.4. nam-sukkal-mah-a-ni mu-ra-an-šum₂ en {d}<nu>-nam-[nir-re]
#lem: namsukkalmah[office of sukkalmah]; šum[give]; en[lord]; Nunamnir[1]DN
#tr.en: and made your name glorious. You are perfectly suited to perform the ordinances of the @wTN{E-kur} in all their complexity, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.4

A.A.5. ŋidru kug šu-za ma-ra-ni-in-ge-en mu-zu dalla bi₂-in-e₃
#lem: ŋidru[scepter]; kug[purify]; šu[hand]; gin[confirm]; mu[name]; dalla[(to be) bright]; e[leave]
#tr.en: to teach the proper execution of the lustrations and the august rites, to purify and clean, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.5

A.A.6. ŋiš-hur e₂-kur-ra šu du₇-du₇ niŋ₂ galam-galam-ma-bi
#lem: ŋešhur[plan]; Ekur[1]TN; šu[hand]; du[perfect]; niŋ[thing]; galam[skilful]
#tr.en: and to make grandly manifest the numerous divine powers, the surpassing divine powers; 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.6

A.A.7. šu-luh ŋarza mah-bi us₂ zid dab₅-be₂ kug-ge sikil-e-bi
#lem: šuluh[ritual cleansing]; ŋarza[rites]; mah[great]; us[path]; zid[right]; dab[seize]; kug[pure]; sikil[pure]
#tr.en: indeed, to give command with grandeur is now consummately and irrevocably yours. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.7

A.A.8. me lu-lu-a me dirig-ga-bi pa e₃ mah ak-bi
#lem: me[Being]; lu[abundant]; me[Being]; dirig[make more than]; pa[branch]; e[leave]; mah[great]; ak[do]
#tr.en: Moreover, you are indeed @wDN{Nuska}, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.8

A.A.9. šu ši-bi₂-du₇-du₇ dug₄-ga nam-gal-la ud til₃-la-še₃ za-a-am₃
#lem: šu[hand]; du[perfect]; dug[speak]; namgal[greatness]; ud[sun]; til[live (of a single person)]; zaʾe[you]
#tr.en: the prince and the counsellor of the @wTN{E-kur}! In the entire extent of heaven and earth, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.9

A.A.10. {d}nuska nun na degₓ(RI) e₂-kur-ra za-e ši-bi₂-in-ga-me-en-nam
#lem: Nuska[1]DN; nun[prince]; na[cvne]; deg[gather up]; Ekur[1]TN; zaʾe[you]; me[be]
#tr.en: in all the countries, you alone are mighty. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.10

A.A.11. an ki šu₂-a kur niŋin₂#-na-ba dili-zu i₃-mah-me-en
#lem: an[sky]; ki[place]; šuš[cover]; kur[mountain(s)]; niŋin[encircle]; dili[single]; mah[great]
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.11

A.A.12. ub-šu-unken-na ki di gal ku₅-ru a₂ aŋ₂-ŋa₂ gal-gal-la-še₃
#lem: Ubšuʾunkenak[1]TN; ki[place]; did[lawsuit]; gal[big]; kud[break off]; a[arm]; aŋ[measure]; gal[big]
#tr.en: The @wDN{Anuna}, the gods of the earth, as many as they are, will gather before you in the @wTN{Ubšu-unkena} where the great verdicts are pronounced and the great commands are given. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.12

A.A.13. {d}a-nun-na diŋir ki a-na me-a gu₂ ma-ra-si-si-de₃-eš
#lem: Anunak[1]DN; diŋir[deity]; ki[place]; ana[what?]; me[be]; gu[neck]; si[fill]
#tr.en: It is you who …… for them the forceful decisions made by @wDN{Enlil}. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.13

A.A.14. eš-bar dug₄-ga u₁₈-ru {d}en-lil₂-la₂ za-e šu# mu-ne-ri-ib-X-en
#lem: ešbar[decision]; dug[speak]; urun[exalted]; Enlil[1]DN; zaʾe[you]; šu[hand]; X
#tr.en: They always pay attention to your holy words, which, like the heavens, can never be grasped fully. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.14

A.A.15. inim kug an-gin₇ šu nu-teŋ₃-ŋe₂₆-zu-še₃ igi-bi šu-mu-e-ši-ŋal₂
#lem: inim[word]; kug[purify]; an[sky]; šu[hand]; teŋ[approach]; igi[eye]; ŋal[⟦be⟧ to be (there]
#tr.en: In (?) the lofty ……, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.15

A.A.16. [...] mah ni₂ guru₃ ki us₂-a-bi nam-bi igi-bi ib-zu-zu-un
#lem: X; mah[great]; ni[fear]; gur[lift]; ki[place]; us[accompany]; nam[fate]; igi[eye]; zu[know]
#tr.en: imbued with awesomeness, firmly founded, you announce their lot. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.16

@div trailer 

A.A.17. [sa]-gid₂#-da-am₃
#lem: sagida[musical notation]
#tr.en: @fsux{Sa-gida}. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.17

@end trailer

@end sa-gida

