@div segment B

B.B.1. [...] X X [...]
#lem: X; X; X; X
#tr.en: Great lord, ……, @wDN{Nuska}, caretaker of the great gods, @wDN{Nuska}, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.1

B.B.2. [...] X [...] me he₂-na-X [...]
#lem: X; X; X; me[Being]; X; X
#tr.en: prince respected in the @wTN{E-kur}, caretaker of ……! Youth who knows well how to give instructions, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.2

$ 2 lines missing
B.B.5. en gal X {[d]}nuska# saŋ en₃# [tar] diŋir gal-gal-e!-ne#
#lem: en[lord]; gal[big]; X; Nuska[1]DN; saŋ[head]; en[cvne]; tar[cut]; diŋir[deity]; gal[big]
#tr.en: who …… decisions; trustworthy god who loves ……, who listens to prayers! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.5

B.B.6. {d}nuska! nun nir-ŋal₂ e₂-kur#-[ra] saŋ en₃ tar X X
#lem: Nuska[1]DN; nun[prince]; nirŋal[authoritative]; Ekur[1]TN; saŋ[head]; en[cvne]; tar[cut]; X; X
#tr.en: When the shining @wTN{E-kur}, the shrine which assigns the divine powers, is made up as for a festival, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.6

B.B.7. šul a₂ aŋ₂-e gal-zu eš-bar X X
#lem: šul[youth]; a[arm]; aŋ[measure]; galanzu[wise]; ešbar[decision]; X; X
#tr.en: and @wDN{Enlil} and @wDN{Ninlil} sit there attractively, may your pure mouth bring friendly words on behalf of @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}}! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.7

B.B.8. diŋir# zid X [...] X ki aŋ₂ [...] šudu₃! ŋiš tuku
#lem: diŋir[deity]; zid[right]; X; X; X; ki[place]; aŋ[measure]; X; šud[prayer]; ŋeš[tree]; tuku[acquire]
#tr.en: Addressing them daily, may he be able to please them unto distant days! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.8

B.B.9. ud e₂-kur za-gin₃ eš₃ me i-i ezen-gin₇ du₃!-a-ba
#lem: ud[sun]; Ekur[1]TN; zagin[lapis lazuli]; eš[shrine]; me[Being]; e[bring out]; ezem[festival]; du[build]
#tr.en: When the house of @wDN{Enlil}, the shrine which assigns the divine powers, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.9

B.B.10. {d}en-lil₂ {d}nin-lil₂-bi hi!-li-a mu-un-dur₂-ru-ne-eš-a-ba
#lem: Enlil[1]DN; Ninlil[1]DN; hili[attractiveness]; durun[sit]
#tr.en: is made up as for a festival, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.10

B.B.11. inim sag₉-ga {d}iš-me-{d}da-gan-na ka kug-zu he₂-em-tum₃
#lem: inim[word]; sag[good]; Išmedagan[1]RN; kag[mouth]; kug[pure]; tum[bring]
#tr.en: and @wDN{Enlil} and @wDN{Ninlil} sit there attractively, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.11

B.B.12. i₃-ne-dug₄ ud šu₂-še₃ e-ne-ne-er su₃-ra₂-še₃ hu-mu-ne-dug₃
#lem: dug[speak]; ud[sun]; šuš[cover]; anene[they]; sud[distant]; dug[good]
#tr.en: may your pure mouth bring friendly words on behalf of @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}}! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.12

B.B.13. ud e₂ {d}en-lil₂-la₂ eš₃ me i-i ezen-gin₇ du₃-a-ba
#lem: ud[sun]; e[house]; Enlil[1]DN; eš[shrine]; me[Being]; e[bring out]; ezem[festival]; du[build]
#tr.en: Addressing them daily, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.13

B.B.14. {d}en-lil₂ {d}nin-lil₂-bi hi-li-a mu-un-dur₂-ru-ne-eš-a-ba
#lem: Enlil[1]DN; Ninlil[1]DN; hili[attractiveness]; durun[sit]
#tr.en: may he be able to please them unto distant days! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.14

B.B.15. inim sag₉-ga {d}iš-me-{d}da-gan-na ka kug-zu he₂-em-tum₃
#lem: inim[word]; sag[good]; Išmedagan[1]RN; kag[mouth]; kug[pure]; tum[bring]
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.15

B.B.16. i₃-ne-dug₄ ud šu₂-še₃ e-ne-ne-er su₃-ra₂-še₃ hu-mu-ne-dug₃
#lem: dug[speak]; ud[sun]; šuš[cover]; anene[they]; sud[distant]; dug[good]
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.16

B.B.17. šudu₃ a-ra-zu-a šu mu₂-mu₂-da-ni igi dug₃ hu-mu-ni-du₈-uš
#lem: šud[prayer]; arazu[supplication]; šu[hand]; mu[grow]; igi[eye]; dug[good]; du[spread]
#tr.en: When he greets them in prayer and supplication, may they look favourably upon him! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.17

B.B.18. til₃ niŋ₂ dug₃ bal dug₃ mu giri₁₇-zal-la za-e e₃-mu-na-ra-ab
#lem: til[live (of a single person)]; niŋ[thing]; dug[good]; bala[turn]; dug[good]; mu[year]; kirizal[joy]; zaʾe[you]; e[leave]
#tr.en: Assign him a good life, a good reign, and years of joy! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.18

B.B.19. en-en gal-gal sig nim-ma-ke₄-ne nun il₂-bi he₂-a
#lem: en[lord]; gal[big]; sig[weak]; nim[high]; nun[prince]; il[raise]; me[be]
#tr.en: May he be elevated to be prince of all the great lords of the south and the uplands! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.19

B.B.20. nam-nun zi-ŋal₂-la# kur-kur uŋ₃ lu-a ul-še₃ he₂-ak-e
#lem: namnun[magnificence]; ziŋal[living things]; kur[mountain(s)]; uŋ[people]; lu[abundant]; ul[distant time]; ak[do]
#tr.en: May he exercise forever the leadership of the living of all lands, the numerous people! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.20

B.B.21. {d}iš-me-{d}da-gan dumu {d}en-lil₂-la₂-ka igi dug₃ hu-mu-ni-du₈-uš
#lem: Išmedagan[1]RN; dumu[child]; Enlil[1]DN; igi[eye]; dug[good]; du[spread]
#tr.en: May they look favourably upon @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}}, son of @wDN{Enlil}! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.21

B.B.22. til₃ niŋ₂ dug₃ bal dug₃ mu giri₁₇-zal-la za-e e₃-mu-na-ra-ab
#lem: til[live (of a single person)]; niŋ[thing]; dug[good]; bala[turn]; dug[good]; mu[year]; kirizal[joy]; zaʾe[you]; e[leave]
#tr.en: Assign him a good life, a good reign, and years of joy! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.22

